Playful physicist warning: very hazardous coast today—25–35 ft breakers (occasional 40–50 ft at Mavericks), coastal flooding, strong gusts—followed by rain and wind Sunday–Monday (Чую, что скоро развергнутся хляби небесные!), with Sunday’s front now expected slightly weaker and less thunder-prone than earlier, but a potentially wetter Tue–Wed system looms.